anna: nice. i'll open a PR tonight with a prototype + unit tests for the reassembler and a small integration test that injects a 401 mid-stream. pinging @mike for review when ready. :rocket:

mike: happy to review. small nit: add comment about unicode surrogate pairs when slicing buffers — use `TextDecoder({ fatal: false })` and `stream: true` consistently.

anna: will do, thanks! :+1:
